  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action to Strengthen Partnerships for Inclusion Resilience and Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth and women South Sudanese refugees and Ugandan host communities, in Bidi Bidi Refugee Settlement, West Nile of Uganda will access climate smart food production opportunities. ASPIRE will promote the block farming approach, climate resilient crops and natural-based solutions for soil enrichment and pest control, and low-cost irrigation. It will strengthen outcomes for the farmer groups through the farmer market school approach to enable bulking of products and price negotiation.</narrative>
  </description>
